      "chat_skill_endpoint": "/chat-skill",
      "chat_skill": "# Langfuse\n\nLLM observability and tracing platform.\n\n## Endpoints\n- `GET /chat/langfuse/projects` \u2014 list configured project aliases\n- `GET /chat/langfuse/{project}/traces` \u2014 list traces (supports `?limit=`, `?page=`, `?tags=`, `?name=`, `?sessionId=`, `?fromTimestamp=`)\n- `GET /chat/langfuse/{project}/traces/{traceId}` \u2014 single trace detail\n- `GET /chat/langfuse/{project}/observations` \u2014 list observations\n- `GET /chat/langfuse/{project}/observations/{observationId}` \u2014 single observation detail\n\n## Authentication\n\nNone required.  The deploy server injects HTTP Basic Auth server-side \u2014\nthe chat container never sees the credentials.\n\n## Projects\n\nUse the `{project}` path parameter to select which Langfuse project's traces to query.  Configured project aliases are listed at `GET /chat/langfuse/projects`.  New project aliases can be added via the `langfuse_projects` config field (dict of alias \u2192 {public_key, secret_key}).",
